; 03 Example.scr - an example series script, as an AutoCAD script, for 03xxx drawings.
; To use it, rename it for its series, copy it up one folder (into "Series Scripts") and put
; your commands in below. Lines starting with ; are comments. Series Scripts saves the drawing
; afterwards - don't QSAVE, CLOSE or QUIT here.
; The LISP variables ttw-dwg-number, ttw-series and ttw-series-name are set, e.g. !ttw-dwg-number
(princ (strcat "\n" ttw-series-name " script on " ttw-dwg-number))
